# This example deliberately authorizes nobody.
# Install a reviewed OpenSSH allowed-signers line outside Git at:
# /etc/dockerswarm/migration/runtime-promotion.allowed-signers
#
# Required principal:
# apptolast-runtime-promotion
# Required signature namespace:
# runtime-promotion@apptolast.com
#
# Example syntax after replacing the complete public key:
# apptolast-runtime-promotion ssh-ed25519 AAAA_REPLACE_COMPLETE_KEY
